{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"barracks","model_identifier":"barracks","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# barracks\n\nBarracks: a long building, stone ground storey and timber upper storey, weapon racks outside and a practice yard with straw targets and a wooden practice post.\n\n- Footprint: 14 x 10 columns (224 x 160 units, 6.30 x 4.50 m), centred on the origin, front (door side) faces -Z.\n- Finished bounds: x -102..106, y 0..178, z -78..76 units.\n- Texture: 512 x 512, 1 px per unit, square pixels, nearest filtering. Every visible face has its own texture region painted with its material at world position (seams line up across faces); identical faces share a region; construction and ruined pieces map into the region of the face they were cut from. No cube is cut to fit the texture.\n- Cubes: finished 213, construction_0 27, construction_33 79, construction_66 91, ruined 25 (6 rotated: roof slabs and a few leaning props).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- barracks: 160 x 176 x 64 centred at x -16, z 40\n- practice yard: fence ring 204 x 16 x 60 at z -46 (walk-through)\n\n## State group sets (children of `root`; show exactly one)\n\n- `finished`: the finished building (visible by default).\n- `construction_0`, `construction_33`, `construction_66`: build progress at 0 %, 33 % and 66 % (staked outline and scaffold, then walls rising inside scaffold, then full frame with roof rafters).\n- `ruined`: collapsed shell, broken walls, rubble, fallen roof (use with `_damaged.png`, or `_abandoned.png` for F7 abandoned buildings).\n- `barracks_damaged.png`: damaged texture (scorch, holes, cracks) for the same UVs; works on every group set.\n- `barracks_abandoned.png`: abandoned look (damage plus moss, faded cloth, cold fires) = `abandoned_barracks` together with the `ruined` set or the finished set.\n\n## Attachment and effect points (empty groups)\n\n- `slot_door` at (-40, 0, -4)\n- `fx_smoke` at (40, 179, 40)\n- `slot_rally` at (60, 0, -46)\n"},"resolution":{"width":512,"height":512},"elements":[{"name":"bk_found","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-98.0,0.0,6.0],"to":[66.0,3.0,74.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[0.0,390.0,164.0,393.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[156.0,393.0,224.0,396.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[0.0,390.0,164.0,393.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[156.0,393.0,224.0,396.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[297.0,0.0,461.0,68.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[297.0,0.0,461.0,68.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"2908f957-8845-5c30-85c3-fcfb01f22975"},{"name":"bk_w0_n","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-96.0,3.0,8.0],"to":[64.0,87.0,12.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[26.0,0.0,186.0,84.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[242.0,0.0,246.0,84.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[26.0,0.0,186.0,84.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[242.0,0.0,246.0,84.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[161.0,372.0,321.0,376.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[161.0,372.0,321.0,376.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"a0f43ab8-5ebf-510b-b315-235a674e4b1a"},{"name":"bk_w0_s","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-96.0,3.0,68.0],"to":[64.0,87.0,72.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[26.0,0.0,186.0,84.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[246.0,0.0,250.0,84.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[26.0,0.0,186.0,84.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[246.0,0.0,250.0,84.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[321.0,372.0,481.0,376.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[321.0,372.0,481.0,376.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"c4026270-1f0a-54aa-a181-a3395b1038c7"},{